\ cat.fam — each path's contents to the output (none: the input's).
: buf variable ;
: copy  begin dup buf @ 200 lit read dup 0< 0= over and while 1 lit buf @ rot write drop repeat 2drop ;
200 lit alloc buf !
1 lit arg 0= if 0 lit copy else
	1 lit begin dup arg ?dup while
		0 lit open dup 0< if
			drop "cat: cannot open " eputs dup arg eputs 0A lit eputc
		else dup copy close drop then
		1 lit +
	repeat drop
then bye
